<component>
    <CaseDocPage
        title={t("case.tag.title")}
        description="Tag 是 RML 的标签组件，标签为 PascalCase Tag。无 ElementId 构造（StatelessNoId），容器模式，文本通过子节点设置。支持 6 种语义 variant + outline 描边样式 + 尺寸控制。适合分类、状态、优先级等元数据展示。"
        code-rml={rml_sample}
        code-rust={rust_sample}>
        <template slot="demo">
            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>变体 variants</h3>
                <p>6 种 variant 通过同名空属性切换（primary / secondary / danger / success / warning / info）。不写 variant 即默认 Default（Secondary 配色）。</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Tag>Default</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="primary">Primary</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="secondary">Secondary</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="danger">Danger</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="success">Success</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="warning">Warning</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="info">Info</Tag>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>描边样式 outline</h3>
                <p>outline 属性切换为描边样式：透明背景 + 彩色边框/文字，常用于次要状态区分。</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Tag variant="primary" outline="">Primary Outline</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="secondary" outline="">Secondary Outline</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="danger" outline="">Danger Outline</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="success" outline="">Success Outline</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="warning" outline="">Warning Outline</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="info" outline="">Info Outline</Tag>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>尺寸 size</h3>
                <p>size 属性控制标签大小：xsmall / small / medium / large。来自 Sizable trait。</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Tag variant="primary" size="xsmall">XSmall</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="primary" size="small">Small</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="primary" size="medium">Medium</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="primary" size="large">Large</Tag>
                </div>
                <p>注：在 gpui-component 底层实现中，Tag 仅支持 Small 与 Medium 两档视觉区分。XSmall 与 Small 共用同一尺寸分支，Medium 与 Large 共用另一分支。建议优先使用 Small/Medium 两档。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>圆角与形状</h3>
                <p>通过 CSS 样式属性控制圆角：rounded-full 实现药丸形状，适用于状态标签。</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Tag variant="primary">Default Radius</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="primary" rounded="full">Pill Shape</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="success" rounded="full" size="small">Small Pill</Tag>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>动态绑定（字段绑定 + if 条件渲染）</h3>
                <p>点击按钮切换标签文本和 variant，观察标签实时变化（演示字段绑定 + if 条件渲染）。</p>
                <p>当前文本: {tag_text} | 当前变体: {variant_label} | 样式: {outline_label}</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Button label="切换变体" variant="primary" on-click={on_cycle_variant} />
                    <Button label="切换 outline" on-click={on_toggle_outline} />
                    <Button label="切换文本" on-click={on_cycle_text} />
                </div>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Tag if={variant_index == 0 && !is_outline}>{tag_text}</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="primary" if={variant_index == 1 && !is_outline}>{tag_text}</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="secondary" if={variant_index == 2 && !is_outline}>{tag_text}</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="danger" if={variant_index == 3 && !is_outline}>{tag_text}</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="success" if={variant_index == 4 && !is_outline}>{tag_text}</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="warning" if={variant_index == 5 && !is_outline}>{tag_text}</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="info" if={variant_index == 6 && !is_outline}>{tag_text}</Tag>
                    <Tag if={variant_index == 0 && is_outline} outline="">{tag_text}</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="primary" if={variant_index == 1 && is_outline} outline="">{tag_text}</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="secondary" if={variant_index == 2 && is_outline} outline="">{tag_text}</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="danger" if={variant_index == 3 && is_outline} outline="">{tag_text}</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="success" if={variant_index == 4 && is_outline} outline="">{tag_text}</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="warning" if={variant_index == 5 && is_outline} outline="">{tag_text}</Tag>
                    <Tag variant="info" if={variant_index == 6 && is_outline} outline="">{tag_text}</Tag>
                </div>
            </div>
        </template>

        <template slot="api">
            <h3>Tag</h3>
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            <p>另：size 属性来自 Sizable trait，font-bold / font-semibold 等字体权重属性来自 StyledExt trait，rounded 等 CSS 属性来自通用样式通道。</p>
        </template>
    </CaseDocPage>
</component>
